      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Multi-Link coronary stents, both 15 and 25 mm, can be used from the radial artery approach with a high degree of efficacy. The complexity of coronary artery stenting is greatly diminished by using the Multi-Link stent delivery system, which eliminates the need for \"bare stenting.\""},
